       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. TLNDISB.
      *================================================================*
      * UNIT TESTS FOR LNDISB - LOAN BOOKING: NUMBERS, CREDIT TO THE   *
      * ACCOUNT, LOAN RECORD AND FAILED CREDIT                         *
      *================================================================*
       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
       FILE-CONTROL.
           SELECT ACCT-FILE ASSIGN TO 'data/ACCTMAST.DAT'
               ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED ACCESS MODE IS RANDOM
               RECORD KEY IS ACCT-NO FILE STATUS IS UT-ACCT-FS.
           SELECT LOAN-FILE ASSIGN TO 'data/LOANMAST.DAT'
               ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED ACCESS MODE IS RANDOM
               RECORD KEY IS LOAN-NO FILE STATUS IS WS-FS.
       DATA DIVISION.
       FILE SECTION.
       FD  ACCT-FILE.
           COPY ACCTREC.
       FD  LOAN-FILE.
           COPY LOANREC.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
           COPY LNDPARM.
           COPY UTWS.
           COPY UTSEEDW.
       01  WS-FS                       PIC X(02).
       01  WS-FIRST-LOAN               PIC 9(10).

       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       0000-MAIN.
           MOVE 'LNDISB' TO UT-SUITE
           MOVE 1000000001 TO UT-SEED-NO
           MOVE 'S' TO UT-SEED-TYPE
           MOVE 'A' TO UT-SEED-STATUS
           MOVE 2000 TO UT-SEED-BALANCE
           MOVE 1000 TO UT-SEED-MIN
           MOVE ZERO TO UT-SEED-OD
           MOVE 'DEL001' TO UT-SEED-BRANCH
           PERFORM UT-SEED-ACCOUNT

           MOVE 'FIRST LOAN BOOKED: RC 00' TO UT-NAME
           PERFORM 8000-SETUP
           CALL 'LNDISB' USING LND-PARMS
           MOVE ZERO TO UT-EXPECTED-NUM
           MOVE LND-RC TO UT-ACTUAL-NUM
           PERFORM UT-ASSERT-NUM
           MOVE LND-LOAN-NO TO WS-FIRST-LOAN
           MOVE 'FIRST LOAN NUMBER 5000000001' TO UT-NAME
           MOVE 5000000001 TO UT-EXPECTED-NUM
           MOVE LND-LOAN-NO TO UT-ACTUAL-NUM
           PERFORM UT-ASSERT-NUM

           MOVE 'ACCOUNT CREDITED WITH THE LOAN' TO UT-NAME
           PERFORM UT-READ-ACCOUNT
           MOVE 102000 TO UT-EXPECTED-NUM
           MOVE ACCT-BALANCE TO UT-ACTUAL-NUM
           PERFORM UT-ASSERT-NUM

           MOVE 'LOAN RECORD: OUTSTANDING = PRINCIPAL' TO UT-NAME
           OPEN INPUT LOAN-FILE
           MOVE WS-FIRST-LOAN TO LOAN-NO
           READ LOAN-FILE INVALID KEY INITIALIZE LOAN-RECORD END-READ
           CLOSE LOAN-FILE
           MOVE 100000 TO UT-EXPECTED-NUM
           MOVE LOAN-OUTSTANDING TO UT-ACTUAL-NUM
           PERFORM UT-ASSERT-NUM
           MOVE 'LOAN RECORD: EMI AS GIVEN' TO UT-NAME
           MOVE 4707.35 TO UT-EXPECTED-NUM
           MOVE LOAN-EMI TO UT-ACTUAL-NUM
           PERFORM UT-ASSERT-NUM
           MOVE 'NEW LOAN IS STANDARD (IRAC CLASS S)' TO UT-NAME
           MOVE 'S' TO UT-EXPECTED-STR
           MOVE LOAN-ASSET-CLASS TO UT-ACTUAL-STR
           PERFORM UT-ASSERT-STR

           MOVE 'SECOND LOAN GETS THE NEXT NUMBER' TO UT-NAME
           PERFORM 8000-SETUP
           CALL 'LNDISB' USING LND-PARMS
           MOVE 5000000002 TO UT-EXPECTED-NUM
           MOVE LND-LOAN-NO TO UT-ACTUAL-NUM
           PERFORM UT-ASSERT-NUM

           MOVE 'UNKNOWN ACCOUNT -> CREDIT FAILED (RC 10)' TO UT-NAME
           PERFORM 8000-SETUP
           MOVE 1999999999 TO LND-ACCT-NO
           CALL 'LNDISB' USING LND-PARMS
           MOVE 10 TO UT-EXPECTED-NUM
           MOVE LND-RC TO UT-ACTUAL-NUM
           PERFORM UT-ASSERT-NUM

           PERFORM UT-FINISH
           STOP RUN.

       8000-SETUP.
           INITIALIZE LND-PARMS
           MOVE 1000000001 TO LND-ACCT-NO
           MOVE 'P' TO LND-TYPE
           MOVE 100000 TO LND-AMOUNT
           MOVE 24 TO LND-TENURE
           MOVE 13.5 TO LND-RATE
           MOVE 4707.35 TO LND-EMI
           MOVE 'F' TO LND-RATE-TYPE
           MOVE 'PERSONAL LOAN' TO LND-NARRATION.

           COPY UTSEEDP.
           COPY UTPROC.
